---
import benchmark from '../data/benchmarks/v1.0.0/writer-cross-runtime.json';

const { locale = 'en' } = Astro.props as { locale?: 'en' | 'ko' };

const labels = {
  'stax-xml': `stax-xml WriterSyncSink (${benchmark.environment.node})`,
  woodstox: `Woodstox ${benchmark.environment.woodstox} (Java ${benchmark.environment.java})`,
  'quick-xml': `quick-xml ${benchmark.environment.quickXml} (Rust ${benchmark.environment.rust})`,
};

function median(values: number[]) {
  const sorted = [...values].sort((a, b) => a - b);
  return sorted[Math.floor(sorted.length / 2)];
}

const rows = Object.entries(benchmark.cases).map(([name, runs]) => ({
  name,
  label: labels[name as keyof typeof labels],
  throughput: median(runs.map((run) => run.throughputMiBs)),
}));
---

<p>
  {locale === 'ko'
    ? `동일한 generator로 ${benchmark.workload.records.toLocaleString('en-US')}개 레코드를 compact XML로 만들고 실제 파일에 기록했습니다. 각 행은 3회 실행의 중앙값입니다.`
    : `The same generator wrote ${benchmark.workload.records.toLocaleString('en-US')} records as compact XML to a real file. Each row is the median of three runs.`}
</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Writer</th><th>{locale === 'ko' ? '중앙 처리량' : 'Median throughput'}</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {rows.map((row) => <tr><td>{row.label}</td><td>{row.throughput.toFixed(1)} MiB/s</td></tr>)}
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>
  {locale === 'ko'
    ? '입력 크기, warm-up, sink와 fixture가 다른 1 GiB Node 전용 측정과 직접 숫자를 섞어 비교하지 않습니다.'
    : 'Do not mix these values directly with the Node-only 1 GiB suite, which uses a different input size, warm-up, sink, and fixture.'}
</p>
